## Briefings

wof-antag-usurper-briefing = You are the Royal Usurper. The Queen's reign ends today, and the throne will be yours. Plot, forge, blackmail or strike, but the guard must never prove it was you. Check your objectives in the character menu.
wof-antag-assassin-briefing = You are an Infiltrating Assassin. Someone has paid for blood, and you never fail a contract. Find your targets, choose your moment, and leave no trail. Check your objectives in the character menu.
wof-antag-smuggler-briefing = You are a Smuggler. The kingdom's treasures are worth far more on the black market. Steal what you're after, keep it out of sight, and bribe whoever gets too curious. Check your objectives in the character menu.

